{"pageid":3353,"title":"Moon Shard","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Moon Shard</span>","revid":20169,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Moon Shard</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c6/Moon_shard.png/revision/latest?cb=20251018152512\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Moon shard\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c6/Moon_shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251018152512\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c6/Moon_shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251018152512 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c6/Moon_shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20251018152512 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Moon shard\" width=\"270\" height=\"67\" data-image-key=\"Moon_shard.png\" data-image-name=\"Moon shard.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Can be sold for <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">candy</a> or used to craft the <a href=\"/wiki/Celestial_Hammer\" title=\"Celestial Hammer\">Celestial Hammer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_Pollaxe\" title=\"Heavenly Pollaxe\">Heavenly Pollaxe</a>, and the <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Staff\" title=\"Lunar Staff\">Lunar Staff</a>.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.68.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">October 4th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"A portion of the moon that's broken off and hit the island. Some say that using different moon shards provide different luck.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Moon Shard</b> is an item added in v1.68.0. In v1.68.1, each <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Moon Shard</strong> received a unique color and name. When you sell it, you will receive 500 <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">Candy</a>.\n</p><p>They can spawn <b>anywhere at night</b>, similar to ghosts and star spawns.\n</p><p>Also the shape of moon is based off the shape of moon on the sky.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Quest Reward\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Waning Crescent Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/89/Waning_Crescent_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest?cb=20241015092827\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Waning Crescent Moon Shard\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/89/Waning_Crescent_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20241015092827\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"151\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Waning Crescent Moon Shard.png\" data-image-key=\"Waning_Crescent_Moon_Shard.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Starlight_Sickle\" title=\"Starlight Sickle\">Starlight Sickle</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Third Quarter Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Third_Quarter_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest?cb=20241015092813\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Third Quarter Moon Shard\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Third_Quarter_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20241015092813\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"155\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Third Quarter Moon Shard.png\" data-image-key=\"Third_Quarter_Moon_Shard.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eclipse_Crossbow\" title=\"Eclipse Crossbow\">Eclipse Crossbow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Waning Gibbous Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Waning_Gibbous_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest?cb=20241015092759\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Waning Gibbous Moon Shard\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Waning_Gibbous_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/129?cb=20241015092759\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"129\" height=\"176\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Waning Gibbous Moon Shard.png\" data-image-key=\"Waning_Gibbous_Moon_Shard.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Celestial_Hammer\" title=\"Celestial Hammer\">Celestial Hammer</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Full Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/Full_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest?cb=20241015092731\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Full Moon Shard\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"140\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Full Moon Shard.png\" data-image-key=\"Full_Moon_Shard.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/Full_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/140?cb=20241015092731\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Staff\" title=\"Lunar Staff\">Lunar Staff</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Waxing Gibbous Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/Waxing_Gibbous_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest?cb=20241015092717\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Waxing Gibbous Moon Shard\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"137\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Waxing Gibbous Moon Shard.png\" data-image-key=\"Waxing_Gibbous_Moon_Shard.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/Waxing_Gibbous_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20241015092717\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_Pollaxe\" title=\"Heavenly Pollaxe\">Heavenly Pollaxe</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>First Quarter Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/First_Quarter_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest?cb=20241015092655\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"First Quarter Moon Shard\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"183\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"First Quarter Moon Shard.png\" data-image-key=\"First_Quarter_Moon_Shard.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/First_Quarter_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20241015092655\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Crater_Chisel\" title=\"Crater Chisel\">Crater Chisel</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Waxing Crescent Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/Waxing_Crescent_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest?cb=20241015092639\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Waxing Crescent Moon Shard\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"145\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Waxing Crescent Moon Shard.png\" data-image-key=\"Waxing_Crescent_Moon_Shard.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/Waxing_Crescent_Moon_Shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20241015092639\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Saw\" title=\"Astral Saw\">Astral Saw</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When starting a new server, Waxing Crescent Moon Shard will always fall first.</li>\n<li>The names of the moon shards are incorrect, due to the illumination area of the waning shards increasing and the illumination area of the waxing shards becoming smaller (should be other way around)</li>\n<li>They spawn in a row ( 1.Waxing Crescent Moon Shard -&gt; 2.Waning Crescent Moon Shard -&gt; 3.Third Quarter Moon Shard -&gt; 4.Waning Gibbous Moon Shard -&gt; 5.Full Moon Shard -&gt; 6.Waxing Gibbous Moon Shard -&gt; 7.First Quarter Moon Shard) after 7th shard, it goes back to the 1st shard restarting the cycle again.</li>\n<li>Similar to night items like fireflies and stars, or new ones like the ghosts, <b>they disappear when the night ends if not claimed by a player</b>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163436\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 62/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019438/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.927      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   43.927      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3353-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163436 and revision id 20169. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Candy","exists":true},{"title":"Celestial Hammer","exists":true},{"title":"H